Pasal 10

SPM sebagaimana dimaksud dalam Pasal 9 memiliki indikacor kineija meliputi:
a. cakupan perempuan dan anak korban kekerasan yang mendapatkan penanganan pengaduan oleh petugas terlatih didalam unit pelayanan terpadu;
b. cakupan perempuan dan anak korban kekerasan yang mendapatkan layanan kesehatan oleh tenaga kesehatan terlatih di Puskesmas dan di Rumah Sakit;
c. cakupan layanan Rehabilitasi Sosial yang diberikan oleh petugas Rehabilitasi Sosial terlatih bagi perempuan dan anak korban kekerasan di dalam unit pelayanan terpadu;
d. cakupan layanan bimbingan rohani yang diberikan oleh petugas bimbingan rohani terlatih bagi perempuan dan anak —* korban kekerasan di dalam unit pelayanan terpadu;
e. cakupan penegakan hukum dari tingkat penyidikan sampai dengan putusan pengadilan atas kasus-kasus kekerasan terhadap perempuan dan anak;
f. cakupan perempuan dan anak korban kekerasan yang mendapatkan layanan bantuan hukum;
g. cakupan layanan pemulangan bagi perempuan dan anak korban kekerasan; danh. cakupan layanan reintegrasi sosial bagi perempuan dan anak korban kekerasan.

translated_text:
Article 10

The MSS as referred to in Article 9 has performance indicators including:
a. coverage of women and children victims of violence who receive complaint handling by trained officers within the integrated service unit;
b. coverage of women and children victims of violence who receive health services by trained health personnel at Community Health Centers and Hospitals;
c. coverage of Social Rehabilitation services provided by trained Social Rehabilitation officers for women and children victims of violence within the integrated service unit;
d. coverage of spiritual guidance services provided by trained spiritual guidance officers for women and children —* victims of violence within the integrated service unit;
e. coverage of law enforcement from the investigation level to court decisions on cases of violence against women and children;
f. coverage of women and children victims of violence who receive legal aid services;
g. coverage of repatriation services for women and children victims of violence; andh. coverage of social reintegration services for women and children victims of violence.
